│      - LIVE mode:  forward to Shoonya API                                    │
│                                                                              │
│  MECHANICS (for reference — Order Agent handles):                            │
│    - SELL legs (center): get SL (buy trigger when price rises) + TP (buy     │
│  limit when price falls)                                                     │
│    - BUY legs (hedges): get NO orders — held to expiry                       │
│    - SL = entry_premium × (1 + sl_pct). TP = entry_premium × (1 - tp_pct)    │
│                                                                              │
│  CRITICAL: Do NOT call place_sl_order or place_tp_order directly.            │
│  Only call place_sl_tp_orders. All orders route through the centralized      │
│  hub.                                                                        │
│                                                                              │
│  Risk limits: max loss per spread = (wing_width - net_credit) * 65.          │
│                                                                              │
│  Output: confirmation JSON with sl_order_ids and tp_order_ids from the       │
│  Order Agent.                                                                │
